# Mechanic: Human named votes during spell resolution.
# Card roles: Stampede supplies the vote, Bears/Courser are Wild results,
# Darksteel Ingot is the optional Free result, Forests supply six mana.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield isolate the voting effect.
# Failure: Missing vote, wrong option identity, or a nonempty stack after selection.
# Compatibility path: Resolution votes use the modal choice envelope.
[metadata]
Name:selvala-vote
Goal:Survive
Turns:5
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Cast Selvala's Stampede, vote Wild or Free, and finish its effects.

